<title>Exploring the derivative of the exponential function</title>
<p><ref>Video</ref> | <ref>Applets</ref> | <ref>Transcript</ref>  </p>
<description>
A guided tour into the reasons that the derivative of the exponential function with base e is the function itself.
</description>


